{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033640/extras/8597c307c881d14d8e832ac5c9a88c44.poster.avif?t=1773425177\" width=64 height=48 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033640/extras/8597c307c881d14d8e832ac5c9a88c44.webm?t=1773425177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Delivery Survivors\u00a0</strong>is a survivor-like action roguelite game. Gather powerful relics and weapons, level up your character, create unique builds and slaughter your way through endless minions and bosses in the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Delivery Survivors</strong> plays like a combination of <i>Brotato</i> and <i>Slay the Spire</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fallen halfway through the delivery? Don\u2019t worry! The Delivery Guild has a wide range of couriers ready to take over the duty, and the knowledge gained from those who met their end will help you plan safer routes in your next attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During each delivery run, you can acquire and upgrade a variety of weapons, as well as collect special relics that influence the flow of the game helping you push back against endless waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033640/extras/04cf46b01044d942d053614d68059ca6.poster.avif?t=1773425177\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033640/extras/04cf46b01044d942d053614d68059ca6.webm?t=1773425177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033640/extras/04cf46b01044d942d053614d68059ca6.mp4?t=1773425177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire various weapons and relics to defeat hordes of monsters and bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge dungeons in a Vampire Survivors-like gameplay, strengthening yourself through wave after wave of battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the map, with each run offering a different experience.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4033640?t=1773425177","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033640/0f1d5070ef4d3286755534b7e93c7212e279aa66/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773425177","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033640/190597a9cfa6001e33c14a93707ef2e5c701cc1b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773425177","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033640/190597a9cfa6001e33c14a93707ef2e5c701cc1b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773425177","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Playtest Live Now!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The 0.0.2 playtest is now live!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The current playtest includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1 Character</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>18 Weapons</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>25 Relics</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 Maps</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo is currently in the works and is planned to release around May\u2013June.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033640/extras/8597c307c881d14d8e832ac5c9a88c44.poster.avif?t=1773425177\" width=64 height=48 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033640/extras/8597c307c881d14d8e832ac5c9a88c44.webm?t=1773425177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Delivery Survivors\u00a0</strong>is a survivor-like action roguelite game. Gather powerful relics and weapons, level up your character, create unique builds and slaughter your way through endless minions and bosses in the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Delivery Survivors</strong> plays like a combination of <i>Brotato</i> and <i>Slay the Spire</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fallen halfway through the delivery? Don\u2019t worry! The Delivery Guild has a wide range of couriers ready to take over the duty, and the knowledge gained from those who met their end will help you plan safer routes in your next attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During each delivery run, you can acquire and upgrade a variety of weapons, as well as collect special relics that influence the flow of the game helping you push back against endless waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033640/extras/04cf46b01044d942d053614d68059ca6.poster.avif?t=1773425177\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033640/extras/04cf46b01044d942d053614d68059ca6.webm?t=1773425177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033640/extras/04cf46b01044d942d053614d68059ca6.mp4?t=1773425177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire various weapons and relics to defeat hordes of monsters and bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge dungeons in a Vampire Survivors-like gameplay, strengthening yourself through wave after wave of battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the map, with each run offering a different experience.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Barbarian Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033640/948663e1170152e5108f63445a1747581b7f9f81/header.jpg?t=1773425177","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4033640/1563844258/2d873bb5d216b6d3f3c4e245c5a369c07e1fa9b0/1770571408/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770572327","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4033640/1563844258/2d873bb5d216b6d3f3c4e245c5a369c07e1fa9b0/1770571408/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770572327","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4033640/1563844258/2d873bb5d216b6d3f3c4e245c5a369c07e1fa9b0/1770571408/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770572327","id":257248772,"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257248772/8bfd488a4d72254a136d9b8bde61c96460eb0796/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1770572327"}],"name":"Delivery Survivors","package_grou